--- !u!114 &6331772247778886345
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3752300061302600148}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "Sudenkorennot\n\nSudenkorennot el\xE4v\xE4t toukkina vedess\xE4 ja aikuisina
      ilmassa. Ne saalistavat hy\xF6nteisi\xE4 ja auttavat pit\xE4m\xE4\xE4n hy\xF6nteism\xE4\xE4r\xE4t
      kurissa. Kosteikoilla tavataan muun muassa keijukorentoja, neitokorentoja ja
      suurempia aitokorentoja. Sudenkorentojen esiintyminen kertoo yleens\xE4 hyv\xE4st\xE4
      veden laadusta."
    sw: "Sl\xE4nd\xF6r\n\nSl\xE4ndor lever som larver i vattnet och som vuxna i luften.
      De jagar insekter och bidrar till att h\xE5lla insektsbest\xE5nden under kontroll.
      I v\xE5tmarker f\xF6rekommer bland annat trollsl\xE4ndor, damsl\xE4ndor och
      st\xF6rre \xE4delsl\xE4ndor. F\xF6rekomsten av sl\xE4ndor \xE4r oftast ett
      tecken p\xE5 god vattenkvalitet."
    en: 'Dragonflies


      Dragonflies live as larvae in the water and as adults
      in the air. They prey on insects and help keep insect populations in check.
      In wetlands, you can find damselflies, skimmers, and larger true dragonflies,
      among others. The presence of dragonflies is usually an indication of good
      water quality.'
